    "dil.lonca_sadakat.c0":"Take the task", "dil.lonca_sadakat.r0":"You wore yourself out for the guild, but your standing rose.", "dil.lonca_sadakat.c1":"Not this time", "dil.lonca_sadakat.r1":"You turned it down; your standing in the guild was a little bruised.",
