    "dil.kusurlu_sikayet.c0":"Refund their money", "dil.kusurlu_sikayet.r0":"You covered their loss; your honesty was the talk of the market.",
    "dil.kusurlu_sikayet.c1":"Blame them", "dil.kusurlu_sikayet.r1":"You threw the man out; but the rumor spread ill of you.",
    "dil.usta_siparis.t":"A Master's Commission", "dil.usta_siparis.x":"A wealthy lord came to your door, seeking a fine, intricate piece that only master hands could craft.",
    "dil.usta_siparis.c0":"Take the order (laborious)", "dil.usta_siparis.r0":"You toiled day and night; the piece enchanted the lord, and your name was spoken with mastery.",
    "dil.usta_siparis.c1":"No time for it", "dil.usta_siparis.r1":"The lord shrugged and sought another door.",
